</nav>

		

		
<!-- Main jumbotron for a primary marketing message or call to action -->
<div class="jumbotron">
	<div class="container">
		<h1>SUPERFAMILY 2</h1>
		<p>SUPERFAMILY is a database of structural and functional annotation for all proteins and genomes.</p>
		<p>The SUPERFAMILY annotation is based on a collection of <strong>hidden Markov models</strong>, which represent structural protein domains at the <a href="http://scop.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/scop/index.html" title="Structural Classification of Proteins">SCOP</a> superfamily level.  A superfamily groups together domains which have an evolutionary relationship.  The annotation is produced by scanning protein sequences from over <a href="\genome\hierarchy"><strong>3,200 completely sequenced genomes</strong></a> against the hidden Markov models</p>
		<p>
		<p><b>SUPERFAMILY 1.75</b> can be accessed from <a href="/SUPERFAMILY" title="SUPERFAMILY version 1.75">legacy-supfam.org</a></p>
		<a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" role="button" href="/about">Learn more &raquo;</a></p>

	</div>
</div>

<div class="page-header">
  <h2>Entry points:</h2>
</div>
<!-- Example row of columns -->
<div class="row">
	<div class="col-md-6">
		<div class="panel panel-default">
			<div class="panel-heading strong">
				Quick Sequence Search
			</div>
			<div class="panel-body">
				<p>Paste a protein sequence in FASTA format, or visit the <a href="/sequence/search">full search page</a> for more options</p>

				<form role="form" action="/sequence/search" method="POST" class="form-horizontal">
					<div class="col-md-9">
						<textarea class="form-control col-md-9" rows="3" name="sequence_text", id="sequence_text" placeholder="Paste your sequence(s) in FASTA format"></textarea>
					</div>
					<div class="col-md-3">
						<button type="submit" class="btn btn-default">Search &raquo;</button>
					</div>
				</form>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="col-md-6">
		<div class="panel panel-default">
			<div class="panel-heading strong">
				Keyword Search
			</div>
			<div class="panel-body">
				<p>Search for superfamily, family or species names plus sequence, <a href="http://scop.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/scop/">SCOP</a>, <a href="http://www.rcsb.org/pdb/">PDB</a> or hidden Markov model IDs.</p>

				<form role="form" class="form-horizontal" action="/site/search" method="POST">
					<div class="col-md-9">
						<input type="text" style="100%" class="form-control" name="keyword" id="keyword" placeholder="Search SUPERFAMILY">
					</div>
					<div class="col-md-3">
						<button type="submit" class="btn btn-default">GO &raquo;</button>
					</div>
				</form>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

</div>

<div class="row">

	<div class="col-md-4">
		<div class="panel panel-default">
			<div class="panel-heading strong">
				SCOP Hierarchy
			</div>
			<div class="panel-body">
				<p>Browse the SCOP hierarchy</p>
				<p><a class="btn btn-default" href="/scop" role="button">Browse &raquo;</a></p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>


	<div class="col-md-4">
		<div class="panel panel-default">
			<div class="panel-heading strong">
				Taxonomic Hierarchy
			</div>
			<div class="panel-body">
				<p>Browse a tree of all the SUPERFAMILY genomes</p>
				<p><a class="btn btn-default" href="/genome/hierarchy" role="button">Browse &raquo;</a></p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="col-md-4">
		<div class="panel panel-default">
			<div class="panel-heading strong">
				Genome Statistics
			</div>
			<div class="panel-body">
				<p>View a variety of statistics on the structural assignment of 3,200 genomes</p>
				<p><a class="btn btn-default" href="/genome/stats" role="button">View details &raquo;</a></p>
			</div>
		</div>

	</div>

</div>


		
		

<hr />
